  "content": "\n\n<!-- Geckolib -->\n<div>\n    <hr>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/geckolib\">\n            <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HHe76Ki.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"244\" height=\"82\" />\n        </a>\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Description -->\n<div>\n    <hr>\n    <center>\n        嘎嘎！Duckling 是一個旨在為你的 Minecraft 世界增添鴨子的模組，讓你的遊戲更加生動有趣！\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Mod Contents -->\n<div>\n    <hr>\n    <div>\n        <h4>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;這個模組新增了什麼？</h4>\n        <ul>\n            <li>🦆 白鴨與綠頭鴨。它們會在河流生物群系中生成</li>\n            <li>🐥 Quacklings：一種可交易的漁夫鴨！在沼澤地帶尋找這些四處遊蕩的家伙吧！</li>\n            <li>🍰 節日水果蛋糕，這是嘎嘎商販們超愛的甜點！</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<!-- Discord -->\n<div>\n    <hr>\n    <center>\n        🦆&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/YXC6Xh82yT\">加入我們的 Discord 伺服器！</a>&nbsp;🦆\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Credits -->\n<div>\n    <hr>\n    <div>\n        <h4>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;製作人員：</h4>\n        <ul>\n            <li>🎨 Frogipher#4778 (美術設計)</li>\n            <li>💻 ThatGravyBoat#0001 (程式開發)</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Comments -->\n<!-- <div>\n    <hr>\n    <center>\n        The horror aspect of the mod has been removed as of the 1.19 release.\n    </center>\n</div> -->\n\n<!-- Credit: Modpacks, Videos, etc. -->\n<div>\n    <hr>\n    <center>\n        只要注明出處，Duckling 便可用於整合包、YouTube 影片等用途。\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n\n<!-- Bisecthosting -->\n<div>\n    <hr>\n    <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/gravy\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f2495544-8c9f-4513-a09d-cac8b85db731.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"auto\" />\n    </a>\n</div>",
